        <p class="section-note"><strong>Oracle unavailable is not an engine failure:</strong> the independent Sharp/ImageMagick ground-truth path could not decode the same two fixtures for every measured engine. PureJsImage's 47 non-exact decodes comprise 38 at or above 40 dB PSNR, 6 from 20 to below 30 dB, and 3 below 10 dB, derived from recorded RMSE. Jimp uses utif2 for TIFF internally, so its matching aggregate outcomes are expected.</p>
